<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Template, written by `autonomous_work_resume.py` at the end of a run that ran
  into the 5-hour session window. The same work as the nightly job, scheduled
  once, shortly after that window is expected to refill — see
  plans/resume-after-five-hour-reset.md.

  It carries --resume rather than --force: the pace gate still applies, so a
  week that has caught up by then correctly does nothing.

  Pinning a Month and a Day as well as an Hour and a Minute is what makes this
  one-shot. launchd has no one-shot calendar job — Hour/Minute alone repeat
  daily, adding Day repeats monthly, adding Month repeats yearly — and a year is
  a one-shot in every sense that matters here. The job cannot boot itself out
  when it fires either: `launchctl bootout` of a label kills that label's own
  running process, and the scheduler's SIGTERM handler would record the run as
  cancelled. So the state file backend/autonomous-work-resume.json is what makes
  a stray fire a no-op, a year later or after a reboot.

  StartCalendarInterval is wall-clock, so a DST change between scheduling and
  firing can move this by an hour in either direction. Harmless: an hour early
  is refused by the limit that has not lifted yet, an hour late is idle.

  Every placeholder here is substituted textually, so do not name one in prose.

  PATH matters more than anything else here: launchd starts jobs with a bare
  environment, and both `uv` and `claude` install under the home directory
  rather than on the default path. A missing PATH entry shows up as
  "command not found" in system.log and nothing else.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.claudeusageoptimizer.autonomouswork.resume</string>

  <!-- A named wrapper rather than /usr/bin/env, so listings show
       "claude-usage-autonomous-work" instead of "env". -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__/backend/claude-usage-autonomous-work</string>
    <string>--resume</string>
  </array>

  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Month</key>
    <integer>__MONTH__</integer>
    <key>Day</key>
    <integer>__DAY__</integer>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>__HOUR__</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>__MINUTE__</integer>
  </dict>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__</string>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__/backend/system.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__/backend/system.log</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>__HOME__/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>__HOME__</string>
  </dict>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
